# Commands Used

## Verify Domain

```powershell
Get-ADDomain
```

## Verify Forest

```powershell
Get-ADForest
```

## List Users

```powershell
Get-ADUser -Filter *
```

## List Groups

```powershell
Get-ADGroup -Filter *
```

## List Organizational Units

```powershell
Get-ADOrganizationalUnit -Filter *
```